[{"answer":"So Jane you'll be off to Denmark soon to do your work placement.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/1_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'm really looking forward to it","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/2_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I've just started packing up all my books to put in storage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/3_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I hope they don't get spoilt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/4_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's okay, my grandfather works in a bookshop","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/5_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and he told me how to pack them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/6_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/7_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He says you have to support the spine","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/8_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"otherwise the paper can come away from the cover.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/9_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah that's obvious.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/10_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He also told me to pack them flat in the box, not on their side,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/11_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"again because they can bend","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/12_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and if you leave them like that for, say, a year,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/13_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"it's quite hard to get them back to their normal shape.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/14_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's pretty clear that ruins them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/15_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but a lot of people just can't be bothered to protect their books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/16_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He always says it's such a shame that publishers don't use better-quality paper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/17_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's the acid in the paper that causes the problem, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/18_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that's why old books go yellow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/19_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You know some of the books my grandfather's given me are like that already.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/20_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I should dump them really if they're going to deteriorate further, but I'd feel bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/21_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"They'll always remind me of him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/22_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He's quite a collector, you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/23_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, if they're important to you...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/24_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I'd regret just throwing them away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/25_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, maybe it's because I was taught to treasure books...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/26_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But I hate seeing students force open the pages of paperbacks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/27_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"They press so hard they end up breaking the spine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/28_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I know,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/29_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but unfortunately, paperbacks aren't designed to last a long time and people know that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/30_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Hardbacks aren't quite as weak.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/31_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, they're different, I suppose.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/32_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But I still don't think people value hardbacks like they used to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/33_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they aren't decorative, are they, like other objects.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/34_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Plus, nowadays, people don't keep them out on shelves as much as they used to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/35_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's such a pity.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/36_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"When I visit someone,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/37_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"if they have, say, a colourful book on a table, it's the first thing I'm drawn to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/38_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I agree,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/39_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and book covers can be a work of art in themselves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/40_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Some are really eye-catching.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/41_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I've always been taught to handle books carefully.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/42_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"If you watch someone take a book off a shelf, well, they usually do it wrong.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/43_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, my grandfather says, you should put your hand right over the top of the book...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/44_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Or, if you can't do that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/45_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"pull the other books on the shelf aside so that you can hold the whole cover.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/46_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"When did you learn all this?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/47_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He watched me pull a heavy book off the shelf when I was small,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/48_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and it fell on the floor and broke apart.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/49_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh dear!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/50_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... I can still remember it!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/51_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You know what I really like?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/52_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"What?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/53_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The smell of new books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/54_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Me too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/55_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"My parents used to laugh at me when I was a kid because I loved putting books up to my nose.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/56_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Almost as much as reading them!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/57_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"New books aren't cheap, though, are they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/58_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess we're lucky we can buy them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/59_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"My grandfather stocks second-hand books as well as new ones","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/60_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and they don't smell quite as good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/61_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd love to have a bookshop like your grandfather.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/62_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"What's it like?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/63_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's quite big.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/64_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's got two floors and an attic,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/65_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and he stocks all kinds of books really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/66_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess he treasures things like first editions and other rare books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/67_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, you might think he'd keep those in the attic or somewhere...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/68_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So they'd be hidden?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/69_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/70_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But he likes people to know that he has them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/71_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So, he puts them out in the shop but makes sure you need a ladder to get them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/72_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. That would prevent any thefts!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/73_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Does he stock books for children?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/74_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He does.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/75_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He particularly likes to encourage kids to read;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/76_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"he always says that he used to sit under the stairs as a child with a pile of books and read them all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/77_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that where he keeps them, then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/78_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Not exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/79_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He's got a dedicated area on the ground floor with cushions","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/80_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"so that parents can enter with their toddlers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/81_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"go there and spend some time reading to them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/82_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh cool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/83_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And then there's a place for pushchairs by the front door.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/84_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And a café if anyone needs refreshments.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/85_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good to know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/86_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"As I said, it's a big shop","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/87_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and there's a storage area out the back as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/88_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, what does he keep there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/89_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Books he wants to throw away?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/90_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He hardly ever throws anything away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/91_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He just leaves unwanted books by the front door for customers to take.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/92_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's very nice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/93_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And books people or institutions have requested, they all go at the far end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/94_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He thinks it's best to keep these out of the main shopping area as they're boxed and new.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/95_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you get your coursebooks from him?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/96_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Naturally.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/97_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He stocks books for a lot of the colleges.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/98_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He used to keep these books on the first floor,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/99_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but now there's a new university in my hometown,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/100_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"he's moved them downstairs to attract the students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/101_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"They're actually part of the coffee shop, on low shelves all around it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/102_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Pretty central then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/103_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll have to take me there some time!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-3-2024-06-24-00-32-41/104_v3.mp3"}]
